<title>BELGIUM: RESEARCH ALERT - BBL cuts Colruyt to 'sell'.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BBL cuts Colruyt to 'sell'.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research report -</p>
<p>    Co name:	    Sector:     Price:     Broker:</p>
<p>    Colruyt	     Retailing   19,225  *  BBL/Vermeulen</p>
<p>COMMENT: Downgraded to SELL from HOLD after strong recent share price performance and company visit. P/E expensive for retailer with no operations outside Belgium. Current poor consumption climate and pressure on margins should lead Colruyt share to underperform the market with peers and justify some profit taking in a sector that we recommend to underweight</p>
<p>Recommendation: SELL Analyst: Philippe Masset +322 5477540</p>
<p>(*) date of research report: 11/07/97</p>
<p> Estimates:   EPS	  pvs est   P/E     Dividend</p>
<p> 1997E	  703   BFR    (703)   27.3	 140 BFR</p>
<p> 1998E	  793   BFR    (793)   24.2	 159 BFR</p>
<p>(If you wish to have your research published on Reuters, contact the Brussels Newsroom on +32 2 287 6810 or fax it to +32 2 230 7710.)</p>
